  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "⭐ Last 10 features:\n- feat: add --base-url CLI option with validation, tests, and docs 2026-03-11\n- feat: add --security-scheme CLI option for specs missing auth (#140) 2026-03-10\n- feat: add Claude Code skill for AI-assisted SDK generation 2026-03-10\n- feat: migrate initialize command from .sln to .slnx format 2026-03-09\n- feat: use default/const values from OpenAPI parameters as C# default parameter values 2026-03-05\n- feat: improve oneOf/anyOf ergonomics with semantic variant naming (#133) 2026-03-05\n- feat: More broad support for .http files 2026-03-04\n- feat: Added support for ServerSentEvents. 2026-03-04\n- feat: Enhance ToTypeString method to handle combined types in OpenAPI 3.1 2026-01-21\n- feat: Update target framework to net10.0 across multiple project files 2026-01-21\n🐞 Last 10 bug fixes:\n- fix: extend numeric constraint sanitization with ExclusiveMin/Max and tests 2026-03-11\n- fix: sanitize extreme integer minimum/maximum values during spec processing 2026-03-11\n- fix: resolve codegen issues with AnyOf types containing enum values 2026-03-10\n- fix: don't emit required keyword for nullable properties with null default 2026-03-10\n- fix: ignore discriminators on non-union types without mapping 2026-03-10\n- fix: don't emit required keyword for const properties with defaults 2026-03-10\n- fix: filter out JsonObject defaults to prevent invalid C# syntax 2026-03-10\n- fix: suppress duplicate CLI action warnings when --generate-cli is not set 2026-03-09\n- fix: handle all-caps words in property name conversion 2026-03-05\n- fix: add System.Net.ServerSentEvents package for non-.NET 10 frameworks 2026-03-04",
